{
  "id": "ISA.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaiah 9",
  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The land of the tribes of Zebulun and Naphtali was once disgraced, but the future will bring honour to this region, from the Mediterranean eastwards to the land on the other side of the Jordan, and even to Galilee itself, where the foreigners live.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Lord has pronounced judgement on the kingdom of Israel, on the descendants of Jacob. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the people of Israel, everyone who lives in the city of Samaria, will know that he has done this. Now they are proud and arrogant. They say, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“The brick buildings have fallen down, but we will replace them with stone buildings. The beams of sycomore wood have been cut down, but we will replace them with the finest cedar.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has stirred up their enemies",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9.11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "their enemies",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the enemies of Rezin.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to attack them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Syria on the east and Philistia on the west have opened their mouths to devour Israel. Yet even so the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s anger is not ended; his hand is still stretched out to punish.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people of Israel have not repented; even though the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Almighty has punished them, they have not returned to him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In a single day the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will punish Israel's leaders and its people; he will cut them off, head and tail. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The old and honourable men are the head — and the tail is the prophets whose teachings are lies! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Those who lead these people have misled them and totally confused them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And so the Lord will not let any of the young men escape, and he will not show pity to any of the widows and orphans, because all the people are godless and wicked and everything they say is evil. Yet even so the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s anger will not be ended, but his hand will still be stretched out to punish.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The wickedness of the people burns like a fire that destroys thorn bushes and thistles. It burns like a forest fire that sends up columns of smoke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Almighty is angry, his punishment burns like a fire throughout the land and destroys the people, and it is everyone for himself. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Everywhere in the country people snatch and eat any bit of food they can find, but their hunger is never satisfied. They even eat their own children! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people of Manasseh and the people of Ephraim attack each other, and together they attack Judah. Yet even so the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s anger is not ended; his hand is still stretched out to punish.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
